     |      Nauru         337000      182      NR
     |      Tuvalu         11300       38      TV
     |      Anguilla       11300      311      AI
     |
     |      In the following example, we will use ``nsmallest`` to select the
     |      three rows having the smallest values in column "population".
     |
     |      >>> df.nsmallest(3, "population")
