     |      specify multiple columns like in the next example.
     |
     |      >>> df.nsmallest(3, ["population", "GDP"])
     |                population  GDP alpha-2
     |      Tuvalu         11300   38      TV
     |      Anguilla       11300  311      AI
     |      Nauru         337000  182      NR
