     |      dog weight  3.0  NaN
     |          height  NaN  4.0
     |      >>> df_multi_level_cols2.stack([0, 1])
     |      cat  weight  kg    1.0
     |           height  m     2.0
     |      dog  weight  kg    3.0
     |           height  m     4.0
     |      dtype: float64
