     |      freq : DateOffset, timedelta, or str, optional
     |          Increment to use from time series API (e.g. 'ME' or BDay()).
     |      **kwargs
     |          Additional keyword arguments are passed into
     |          `DataFrame.shift` or `Series.shift`.
