           a  right_val
        0  1          1
        1  2          2
        2  3          3
        3  6          6
        4  7          7

        >>> pd.merge_asof(left, right, on="a")
            a left_val  right_val
        0   1        a          1
        1   5        b          3
        2  10        c          7

