          key  lvalue group  rvalue
        0   a       1     a     NaN
        1   b       1     a     1.0
        2   c       2     a     2.0
        3   d       2     a     3.0
        4   e       3     a     3.0
        5   a       1     b     NaN
        6   b       1     b     1.0
        7   c       2     b     2.0
        8   d       2     b     3.0
        9   e       3     b     3.0

